        <keyword>까지</keyword>
        <keyword>가역단열팽창</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>200</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 화공열역학 · 가역 단열 팽창의 최종온도
정답은 ②이다. T₂ = T₁(P₂/P₁)^(R/C_P) = 400 × (1/4)^(1/2) = 200K이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
